(1950141, 268979, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  A REAL mouse!!!  Real CHEESE!!!  Congrats on putting it together.  And congrats on your soon to be ribbon - I hope anyway.<br/> <br/>Oh yeah - nice photo too.  Nice use of DOF and ROT in your composition.  Lighting is right on as is the focal point.</td>', 'Hey!  A REAL mouse!!!  Real CHEESE!!!  Congrats on putting it together.  And congrats on your soon to be ribbon - I hope anyway. Oh yeah - nice photo too.  Nice use of DOF and ROT in your composition.  Lighting is right on as is the focal point.', '2005-12-14 08:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950176, 266212, 21816, '<td valign="top">This photo is just way too overblown for my taste and the focus looks soft on the eyes. I''m trying to see where the cheese relation is with the title and all I can see is something sticking out of her mouth?</td>', 'This photo is just way too overblown for my taste and the focus looks soft on the eyes. I''m trying to see where the cheese relation is with the title and all I can see is something sticking out of her mouth?', '2005-12-14 08:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950179, 268850, 43115, '<td valign="top">It''s a good concept, but there are a few things wrong with this photo:<br/> <br/>1) There''s a blue cast to the whole thing.<br/>2) The background is odd and doesn''t add anything to the photo.<br/>3) The lighting is poor.<br/>4) There are sensor dust spots in the upper right corner.<br/> <br/>I think this concept needed a little more development to make a better photo.</td>', 'It''s a good concept, but there are a few things wrong with this photo: 1) There''s a blue cast to the whole thing.2) The background is odd and doesn''t add anything to the photo.3) The lighting is poor.4) There are sensor dust spots in the upper right corner. I think this concept needed a little more development to make a better photo.', '2005-12-14 08:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
