(1950744, 269017, 45790, '<td valign="top">I thought it was funny. Best attempt I''ve seen here to but face on cheese. But top slice is annoying -- better to lay it flat on plate and show it as an open-face sandwich.</td>', 'I thought it was funny. Best attempt I''ve seen here to but face on cheese. But top slice is annoying -- better to lay it flat on plate and show it as an open-face sandwich.', '2005-12-14 11:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
