(1953637, 268948, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know whether to laugh or cry.  this is gross.  i admire your effort, but am not quite sure how to reward you.  yes, you are dedicated, and i''m sure you realized your vision.  however, part of me simply gags at seeing this.  kinda like having to change a diaper because noone else is around and you can''t stand the smell anymore.</td>', 'i don''t know whether to laugh or cry.  this is gross.  i admire your effort, but am not quite sure how to reward you.  yes, you are dedicated, and i''m sure you realized your vision.  however, part of me simply gags at seeing this.  kinda like having to change a diaper because noone else is around and you can''t stand the smell anymore.', '2005-12-15 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
