(1953809, 266321, 47487, '<td valign="top">1/2 focus -- focus is on the corner of the mousetrap, but is clear<br/>2/3 composition (inc. background) Would have liked to have seen more tail on the mouse, and you can see the thread holding the cheese;, otherwise excellent<br/>1/3 color/lighting -- I like the glow from beneath, but unfortunately it places the mouse in heavy shadow. The monochrome look of the picture is suitable and appealing.<br/>2/2 artistry/emotive/WOW factor -- This is cute and it made me smile.<br/> <br/>Total score 6/10<br/></td>', '1/2 focus -- focus is on the corner of the mousetrap, but is clear2/3 composition (inc. background) Would have liked to have seen more tail on the mouse, and you can see the thread holding the cheese;, otherwise excellent1/3 color/lighting -- I like the glow from beneath, but unfortunately it places the mouse in heavy shadow. The monochrome look of the picture is suitable and appealing.2/2 artistry/emotive/WOW factor -- This is cute and it made me smile. Total score 6/10', '2005-12-15 11:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
