(1955333, 266955, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very good.  Obviously your title helps but even without it, more than half a second looking at ''most'' should ''get it''.  Can''t see the pun is original but I have not seen it done ''visually'', so well done.  Criticism; in my opinion, if you could have ''somehow'' (angle/perspective variation likely) shot this without the base of the carving(s) visible, would have helped this ''illusion'' to be even better.  The lighting is ''directed'' well but perhaps a little variation or subtlety may have also given this extra ''drama''.  Perhaps a little ''closer'' too would also have been better, even just for more detail/texture on the ''characters''.</td>', '6 - Very good.  Obviously your title helps but even without it, more than half a second looking at ''most'' should ''get it''.  Can''t see the pun is original but I have not seen it done ''visually'', so well done.  Criticism; in my opinion, if you could have ''somehow'' (angle/perspective variation likely) shot this without the base of the carving(s) visible, would have helped this ''illusion'' to be even better.  The lighting is ''directed'' well but perhaps a little variation or subtlety may have also given this extra ''drama''.  Perhaps a little ''closer'' too would also have been better, even just for more detail/texture on the ''characters''.', '2005-12-15 23:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
