(1957467, 268977, 14476, '<td valign="top">Really good take on the challenge and nicely photographed as well.  Normally, I''d worry about the half &amp; half composition, but this time, it works for me!</td>', 'Really good take on the challenge and nicely photographed as well.  Normally, I''d worry about the half & half composition, but this time, it works for me!', '2005-12-16 22:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
