(1957507, 266955, 47096, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  Nicely composed and very effective lighting.</td>', 'Hilarious!  Nicely composed and very effective lighting.', '2005-12-16 23:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957508, 268977, 47096, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Like the dramatic lighting.</td>', 'Great idea. Like the dramatic lighting.', '2005-12-16 23:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957510, 267219, 47096, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Beautifully executed. I love the austerity of this composition. The only thing that bothers me is the smudge or reflection to just next to the right-hand piece of cheese.</td>', 'Great idea. Beautifully executed. I love the austerity of this composition. The only thing that bothers me is the smudge or reflection to just next to the right-hand piece of cheese.', '2005-12-16 23:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957512, 268581, 47096, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle colors and great texture.</td>', 'Nice subtle colors and great texture.', '2005-12-16 23:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957515, 268653, 47096, '<td valign="top">Is that cat a Packers fan?  :) Nice composition. Love the expression on the cat''s face.</td>', 'Is that cat a Packers fan?  :) Nice composition. Love the expression on the cat''s face.', '2005-12-16 23:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957552, 266955, 32754, '<td valign="top">It took a lot of courage to enter this shot!  A lot of people will be upset..BUT...it made me laugh out loud!  I like the light shining on the cheese, excellent touch.</td>', 'It took a lot of courage to enter this shot!  A lot of people will be upset..BUT...it made me laugh out loud!  I like the light shining on the cheese, excellent touch.', '2005-12-16 23:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957817, 268881, 48876, '<td valign="top">Great Idea!</td>', 'Great Idea!', '2005-12-17 03:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957818, 268582, 48876, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!!!</td>', 'What a cutie!!!', '2005-12-17 03:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957832, 268881, 49736, '<td valign="top">Cheeky cheese! This is cool.</td>', 'Cheeky cheese! This is cool.', '2005-12-17 04:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1957910, 268852, 25355, '<td valign="top">That''s not a mouse, that''s a hamster, and his favourite food is sunflower seeds.</td>', 'That''s not a mouse, that''s a hamster, and his favourite food is sunflower seeds.', '2005-12-17 08:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958207, 269017, 43115, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute idea, but it suffers from some technical challenges to make it really come through to the viewer.<br/> <br/>1) I would have used deli sliced cheese (or even sliced your own off a loaf of velveeta) to make the cheese itself look more attractive.<br/>2) Clean up the crumbs from the plate.<br/>3) The lighting is poor, get rid of the shadows!<br/>4) Nothing is critically sharp or really in focus.  Use focus to draw the viewer to what you want them to see.<br/> <br/>I hope these comments help.</td>', 'It''s a cute idea, but it suffers from some technical challenges to make it really come through to the viewer. 1) I would have used deli sliced cheese (or even sliced your own off a loaf of velveeta) to make the cheese itself look more attractive.2) Clean up the crumbs from the plate.3) The lighting is poor, get rid of the shadows!4) Nothing is critically sharp or really in focus.  Use focus to draw the viewer to what you want them to see. I hope these comments help.', '2005-12-17 12:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958213, 266653, 42005, '<td valign="top">This is the most clever of all the entries.  Greeat Work. Must have been fun to create.</td>', 'This is the most clever of all the entries.  Greeat Work. Must have been fun to create.', '2005-12-17 12:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958308, 268979, 43115, '<td valign="top">This is just a phenominal photograph.  The sharpness is just incredible on the mouse and the central mouse trap and the colors are just incredible.  Great job, I can''t imagine how to improve it.  10!</td>', 'This is just a phenominal photograph.  The sharpness is just incredible on the mouse and the central mouse trap and the colors are just incredible.  Great job, I can''t imagine how to improve it.  10!', '2005-12-17 13:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958312, 268927, 43115, '<td valign="top">I know this scene all too well!  :)<br/> <br/>I love the white, the negative space... I love his eyes neatly in a ''rule of thirds'' intersection.  I love everything about this photo.  You can''t improve on perfection! 10!</td>', 'I know this scene all too well!  :) I love the white, the negative space... I love his eyes neatly in a ''rule of thirds'' intersection.  I love everything about this photo.  You can''t improve on perfection! 10!', '2005-12-17 13:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958314, 267560, 43115, '<td valign="top">This is just a great photo.  The scene is just so whimsical and cute.  The sharpness and detail are incredible.  This photo tells a story, and even if it is a comedy instead of the moody dramas preferred by DPC, I love it.  10!</td>', 'This is just a great photo.  The scene is just so whimsical and cute.  The sharpness and detail are incredible.  This photo tells a story, and even if it is a comedy instead of the moody dramas preferred by DPC, I love it.  10!', '2005-12-17 13:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958337, 267443, 43115, '<td valign="top">It''s a moderatley interesting portrait, but it''s link to the challenge (which specified actual cheese) isn''t there.  It also looks quite washed out as a B&amp;W... I wonder if you couldn''t have added more contrast in the post processing (or left it color).</td>', 'It''s a moderatley interesting portrait, but it''s link to the challenge (which specified actual cheese) isn''t there.  It also looks quite washed out as a B&W... I wonder if you couldn''t have added more contrast in the post processing (or left it color).', '2005-12-17 13:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958341, 267907, 43115, '<td valign="top">IMHO the challenge called for actual cheese, not an example of the cliche.  It''s a pretty good photo, which saved you from a ''1'' but not on target enough for me.</td>', 'IMHO the challenge called for actual cheese, not an example of the cliche.  It''s a pretty good photo, which saved you from a ''1'' but not on target enough for me.', '2005-12-17 13:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958343, 268884, 43115, '<td valign="top">Honestly not sure what this has to do with cheese, or even what I am looking at.</td>', 'Honestly not sure what this has to do with cheese, or even what I am looking at.', '2005-12-17 13:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958346, 266905, 43115, '<td valign="top">Lacks sharpness and focus.  Also, I would suggest trying a background, even if its just sheets of construction paper or poster board, to eliminate distracting backgrounds.  It looks like you just set this on your dining room table and took a snapshot.</td>', 'Lacks sharpness and focus.  Also, I would suggest trying a background, even if its just sheets of construction paper or poster board, to eliminate distracting backgrounds.  It looks like you just set this on your dining room table and took a snapshot.', '2005-12-17 13:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958349, 268492, 43115, '<td valign="top">I ''get it,'' but it''s not very attractive. :(  I don''t care for the light fall off on the right side or the random specks of dirt (or whatever) all around the shot.</td>', 'I ''get it,'' but it''s not very attractive. :(  I don''t care for the light fall off on the right side or the random specks of dirt (or whatever) all around the shot.', '2005-12-17 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958352, 268762, 43115, '<td valign="top">Rough night?  I don''t get what this has to do with the challenge, at all. :(</td>', 'Rough night?  I don''t get what this has to do with the challenge, at all. :(', '2005-12-17 13:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958355, 267348, 43115, '<td valign="top">Totally irrevelant to the challenge.  However, it''s a neat shot, which saves you from a 1.</td>', 'Totally irrevelant to the challenge.  However, it''s a neat shot, which saves you from a 1.', '2005-12-17 13:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958360, 266212, 43115, '<td valign="top">Way too over exposed.  I have no clue what is sticking out of her ear, or what this has to do with cheese.  Unless that''s cheese sticking out of her ear, but I can''t tell because it''s way over exposed. :(</td>', 'Way too over exposed.  I have no clue what is sticking out of her ear, or what this has to do with cheese.  Unless that''s cheese sticking out of her ear, but I can''t tell because it''s way over exposed. :(', '2005-12-17 13:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958367, 267612, 43115, '<td valign="top">I honestly have NO clue what this has to do with the challenge.</td>', 'I honestly have NO clue what this has to do with the challenge.', '2005-12-17 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958368, 268898, 43115, '<td valign="top">Cute, but too oppertunistic.  Not a strong enough tie to the challenge for me, which, IMHO, suggested actual cheese.</td>', 'Cute, but too oppertunistic.  Not a strong enough tie to the challenge for me, which, IMHO, suggested actual cheese.', '2005-12-17 13:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958374, 268893, 43115, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot.<br/> <br/>However, it''s not what I would consider the best interpretation of the challenge.  Photos which <i>depend</i> on the title to be linked to the challenge are not as strong an entry as those that scream out the challenge title on their own.<br/> <br/>Enter it in an astrophotography contest and you''ve got a winner.</td>', 'This is a stunning shot. However, it''s not what I would consider the best interpretation of the challenge.  Photos which depend on the title to be linked to the challenge are not as strong an entry as those that scream out the challenge title on their own. Enter it in an astrophotography contest and you''ve got a winner.', '2005-12-17 13:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1958378, 268484, 43115, '<td valign="top">Tired idea, and not the best executed of the entries in this class.  Crop out the dog.</td>', 'Tired idea, and not the best executed of the entries in this class.  Crop out the dog.', '2005-12-17 13:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
