(1960612, 266242, 47852, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot!  I love the expression and energy captured in this one.  One of my favorites from the challenge!  Nicely done and good luck!</td>', 'What a fun shot!  I love the expression and energy captured in this one.  One of my favorites from the challenge!  Nicely done and good luck!', '2005-12-18 18:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960613, 268882, 47852, '<td valign="top">Such an intent look from the cat, and I love the way the ''mouse'' is looking up at his predator!  Nicely composed and captured.  One of my favorites from the challenge!  Good luck on a ribbon!</td>', 'Such an intent look from the cat, and I love the way the ''mouse'' is looking up at his predator!  Nicely composed and captured.  One of my favorites from the challenge!  Good luck on a ribbon!', '2005-12-18 18:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960618, 268436, 47852, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  I was of the belief that the pictures had to have actual cheese in them somewhere for this challenge, but this is just too great of a shot of "say cheese" to vote down!  A definate shot that should be hanging on a proud parent''s wall somewhere.  Wonderful job!</td>', 'Adorable!  I was of the belief that the pictures had to have actual cheese in them somewhere for this challenge, but this is just too great of a shot of "say cheese" to vote down!  A definate shot that should be hanging on a proud parent''s wall somewhere.  Wonderful job!', '2005-12-18 18:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1960720, 268582, 29902, '<td valign="top">Love it!<br/></td>', 'Love it!', '2005-12-18 19:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961051, 269007, 24940, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  (Hence the "8" score.)  However, I think the silverware is a bit superfluous and for the life of me, I can''t see how it fits in.  Besides, there''s something on the fork (or is it a reflection of the lighted fuse?) that is somewhat distracting.  In any case, I feel the s/w just clutters the scene and doesn''t add much to it.  That said, cool lidea ans kudos for sharpness and lighting.</td>', 'I like this picture.  (Hence the "8" score.)  However, I think the silverware is a bit superfluous and for the life of me, I can''t see how it fits in.  Besides, there''s something on the fork (or is it a reflection of the lighted fuse?) that is somewhat distracting.  In any case, I feel the s/w just clutters the scene and doesn''t add much to it.  That said, cool lidea ans kudos for sharpness and lighting.', '2005-12-18 21:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961126, 268900, 2780, '<td valign="top">Is this a very tight crop into the original image? It seems to be a bit blurry. An unsharp mask would probably help a small part but the best way to make it sharper would be not to get quite so close to the subject :)</td>', 'Is this a very tight crop into the original image? It seems to be a bit blurry. An unsharp mask would probably help a small part but the best way to make it sharper would be not to get quite so close to the subject :)', '2005-12-18 22:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1961131, 267219, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white, its very effective in such a high contrast photo.</td>', 'I like the black and white, its very effective in such a high contrast photo.', '2005-12-18 22:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
