(1963559, 266913, 40718, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m not voting this challenge, but this picture is PRICELESS!  I absolutely love it.  The model''s expression is one of satiric perfection.  I''d give it a 10, but I don''t want to vote on 20% of the rest to make it count. (I didn''t like the challenge before it even started). Still, had to comment and leave you big kudos.  I''ll be excited to see who had the guts to pull this off...<br/> <br/>Do you really have pink walls? or is there quite a cast to the picture?</td>', 'Sorry, I''m not voting this challenge, but this picture is PRICELESS!  I absolutely love it.  The model''s expression is one of satiric perfection.  I''d give it a 10, but I don''t want to vote on 20% of the rest to make it count. (I didn''t like the challenge before it even started). Still, had to comment and leave you big kudos.  I''ll be excited to see who had the guts to pull this off... Do you really have pink walls? or is there quite a cast to the picture?', '2005-12-19 19:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
