(1965226, 268979, 44490, '<td valign="top">The live critter counts, hope it survived the gauntlet.  There''s too much out-of-focus foreground - more DOF would have made this great.</td>', 'The live critter counts, hope it survived the gauntlet.  There''s too much out-of-focus foreground - more DOF would have made this great.', '2005-12-20 15:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965228, 268905, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice smile. The lighting is good.  What detracts for me is the busy pattern on her sweater. Maybe if you did it in black and white there wouldn''t be so many color variations. You could crop out part of it and her hair and it''d still have a nice feel to it.</td>', 'Nice smile. The lighting is good.  What detracts for me is the busy pattern on her sweater. Maybe if you did it in black and white there wouldn''t be so many color variations. You could crop out part of it and her hair and it''d still have a nice feel to it.', '2005-12-20 15:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965230, 266242, 15711, '<td valign="top">Darling.  I like the movement of her hair.  I feel the overall color is a tad dim, but maybe that was your intent. The crop is different and I like the "chopped off hat" thing. 7</td>', 'Darling.  I like the movement of her hair.  I feel the overall color is a tad dim, but maybe that was your intent. The crop is different and I like the "chopped off hat" thing. 7', '2005-12-20 15:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965232, 269006, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great stock photography. Ritz would like this image.  I think the black frame is a bit distracting. There isn''t any black in the photo, so it seems a bit stark for my taste. Nice clarity and detail on the cheese, cracker and salami.</td>', 'Great stock photography. Ritz would like this image.  I think the black frame is a bit distracting. There isn''t any black in the photo, so it seems a bit stark for my taste. Nice clarity and detail on the cheese, cracker and salami.', '2005-12-20 15:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965241, 268436, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is such an adorable portrait.  Her eyes just shine!! Love the tilt and the off angle of the frame. Reminds me of those ads for the Hewlitt Packard photo printer.  Really good - probaby the best shot of the challenge. I don''t even think it''s cheesy, but it''s so good, I''m giving it a 10 anyway.</td>', 'This is such an adorable portrait.  Her eyes just shine!! Love the tilt and the off angle of the frame. Reminds me of those ads for the Hewlitt Packard photo printer.  Really good - probaby the best shot of the challenge. I don''t even think it''s cheesy, but it''s so good, I''m giving it a 10 anyway.', '2005-12-20 15:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965243, 266955, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is just the funniest thing I''ve ever seen. I''m sure you''ll get slammed by fundamentalists, but I think it is so clever and imaginative.  Not the best photo, but the idea is hilarious.  I''m in a holiday mood - 8</td>', 'This is just the funniest thing I''ve ever seen. I''m sure you''ll get slammed by fundamentalists, but I think it is so clever and imaginative.  Not the best photo, but the idea is hilarious.  I''m in a holiday mood - 8', '2005-12-20 15:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965304, 268436, 41746, '<td valign="top">Even though the idea is not the most orginal one the smile of the girl is orginal and sincere. One of best images.. still. 9.</td>', 'Even though the idea is not the most orginal one the smile of the girl is orginal and sincere. One of best images.. still. 9.', '2005-12-20 15:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965307, 266242, 41746, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a genuine smile. Very good. 8.</td>', 'This seems to be a genuine smile. Very good. 8.', '2005-12-20 16:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965312, 268851, 41746, '<td valign="top">Strong image. Well captured and processed. 8.</td>', 'Strong image. Well captured and processed. 8.', '2005-12-20 16:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965316, 268977, 41746, '<td valign="top">Amazing idea and the processing very good. Must be a winner. 9.</td>', 'Amazing idea and the processing very good. Must be a winner. 9.', '2005-12-20 16:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1965318, 268881, 41746, '<td valign="top">Orginal idea and nice image. Not so sure about the frame... though. 7.</td>', 'Orginal idea and nice image. Not so sure about the frame... though. 7.', '2005-12-20 16:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
