(1968781, 268324, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>"Yon Cassius has a lean and hungry look..."  (And a big nose too)<br/> <br/>Wow, I never thought I''d get to critique one of <i>your</i> images...  This is going to be difficult because I, like most of your other commentors, scored this high.  <br/> <br/>Crisp where needed and blurred appropriately.  <br/> <br/>I suppose those who were looking somewhat literally and hurriedly, at the image, worried about the lack of focus on the man, without thinking of the story.  It does tell a good story and is well photographed.<br/> <br/>I do wish you had given your Tv, Av &amp; ISO, but you didn''t and that''s the way it goes.<br/> <br/>Nice work, of course.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  "Yon Cassius has a lean and hungry look..."  (And a big nose too) Wow, I never thought I''d get to critique one of your images...  This is going to be difficult because I, like most of your other commentors, scored this high.   Crisp where needed and blurred appropriately.   I suppose those who were looking somewhat literally and hurriedly, at the image, worried about the lack of focus on the man, without thinking of the story.  It does tell a good story and is well photographed. I do wish you had given your Tv, Av & ISO, but you didn''t and that''s the way it goes. Nice work, of course. ', '2005-12-21 16:49:36.000000', NULL, 0),
