(1970809, 268927, 28710, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture. It is so well laid out that I doubt anyone even really noticed the wrinkles in the backdrop sheet in the top right corner. If you are anything like me, you probably worried heaps about that, but FWIW, I didn''t really mind them because of the way they lined up and the hue that the shadows took.<br/> <br/>Really well done. You are lucky that his hair is the colour of cheese.<br/> <br/>Great way to remove the bulkiness of those diapers too.</td>', 'Fantastic picture. It is so well laid out that I doubt anyone even really noticed the wrinkles in the backdrop sheet in the top right corner. If you are anything like me, you probably worried heaps about that, but FWIW, I didn''t really mind them because of the way they lined up and the hue that the shadows took. Really well done. You are lucky that his hair is the colour of cheese. Great way to remove the bulkiness of those diapers too.', '2005-12-22 09:35:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1970904, 266653, 47117, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by graphicfunk:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh Rose! This image is missing only missing a ribbon. I think you did an outstanding job here. It is indeed a beauty and one that I would try to market to the cheese industry. <br/> <br/>Regardless, Congratulations on your top 5th placing and yes, you should have placed above my cheesehenge which used the cheese to portray stone. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Funny, I just wrote you on that placement.  Thanks for all the compliments by the way, and your comment before the end of the challenge was SO SWEET! Thanks!!<br/> <br/>I don''t understand our placements though. Our scores were tied, but I did have an overall higher average of scores that show to the right of the photos?  So I am a bit confused on the placement.<br/> <br/>In any case, thanks again for your compliments, and I will try your suggestion of marketing. LOL...<br/> <br/>Rose</td>', 'Originally posted by graphicfunk: Oh Rose! This image is missing only missing a ribbon. I think you did an outstanding job here. It is indeed a beauty and one that I would try to market to the cheese industry.  Regardless, Congratulations on your top 5th placing and yes, you should have placed above my cheesehenge which used the cheese to portray stone.   Funny, I just wrote you on that placement.  Thanks for all the compliments by the way, and your comment before the end of the challenge was SO SWEET! Thanks!! I don''t understand our placements though. Our scores were tied, but I did have an overall higher average of scores that show to the right of the photos?  So I am a bit confused on the placement. In any case, thanks again for your compliments, and I will try your suggestion of marketing. LOL... Rose', '2005-12-22 10:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
