(1973122, 268861, 43115, '<td valign="top">I had this pegged as a kpriest ^H^H^H Art ROTFLMAO original.  Good thing I didn''t call you out in the comments. :)<br/> <br/>I loved this one.  A comment that I didn''t get a chance to make during the voting is that I love the low-key lighting on this shot.  I''ve got to start working on quashing the urge to throw 600 W/S of strobes at everything I photograph.  The more I look at DPC the more I realize that good photography is as much about shadow as it is about light.  This shot is an example of that.<br/> <br/>Again, good job and congrats on your top 20.</td>', 'I had this pegged as a kpriest ^H^H^H Art ROTFLMAO original.  Good thing I didn''t call you out in the comments. :) I loved this one.  A comment that I didn''t get a chance to make during the voting is that I love the low-key lighting on this shot.  I''ve got to start working on quashing the urge to throw 600 W/S of strobes at everything I photograph.  The more I look at DPC the more I realize that good photography is as much about shadow as it is about light.  This shot is an example of that. Again, good job and congrats on your top 20.', '2005-12-23 01:22:31.000000', NULL, 0),
