(1994761, 266913, 39664, '<td valign="top">No matter how this ended up scoring, you pulled off an amazing <b>71 comments!</b>  That has to be up there in the higher records!  This photo made me laugh then wonder why I laughed!  I think folks should lighten up and realize this entry was <b> VERY creative and VERY brave! </b> <br/> <br/>God help us if you admit to "cutting the cheese" while making this shot!  LOL!</td>', 'No matter how this ended up scoring, you pulled off an amazing 71 comments!  That has to be up there in the higher records!  This photo made me laugh then wonder why I laughed!  I think folks should lighten up and realize this entry was  VERY creative and VERY brave!   God help us if you admit to "cutting the cheese" while making this shot!  LOL!', '2006-01-02 11:05:14.000000', NULL, 0),
